"""Canonical Raster 90 weather animation frames.

This module promotes the reviewed weather-idle v4 study into production source.
It deliberately stores exact source-cell frames rather than presentation GIFs or
renderer-specific timing.  Phase 0 is always the selected static icon; WFF plays
phases 0..7 once at four frames per second, then restores phase 0.

Each encoded frame contains the 15x15 drawable field separated by ``/``.  The
decoder restores the transparent trailing row and column required by the stable
16x16 runtime tile.  This keeps the reviewed pixels compact while preserving the
project's one-cell-at-a-time authorship and deterministic asset generation.
"""

